<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="64" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">If the application or the construction documents do not conform to the requirements of pertinent laws, the building official shall reject such application in writing, stating the reasons therefor.</source>
<target xml:space="preserve"></target>
