<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="78" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">In commercial or industrial buildings, for each floor or portion thereof designed for live loads exceeding 50 psf (2.40 kN/m2), such design live loads shall be conspicuously posted by the owner or the owner's authorized agent in that part of each story in which they apply, using durable signs.</source>
