<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="82" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">It shall be unlawful to place, or cause or permit to be placed, on any floor or roof of a building, structure or portion thereof, a load greater than is permitted by this code.</source>
