<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="86" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">Submittal documents consisting of construction documents, statement of special inspections, geotechnical report and other data shall be submitted in two or more sets, or in a digital format where allowed by the building official, with each permit application.</source>
