<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="87" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">The building official is authorized to waive the submission of construction documents and other data not required to be prepared by a registered design professional if it is found that the nature of the work applied for is such that review of construction documents is not necessary to obtain compliance with this code.</source>
