<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="95" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">The construction documents shall show in sufficient detail the location, construction, size and character of all portions of the means of egress including the path of the exit discharge to the public way in compliance with the provisions of this code.</source>
