<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="95" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">In other than occupancies in Groups R-2, R-3, and I-1, the construction documents shall designate the number of occupants to be accommodated on every floor, and in all rooms and spaces.</source>
