<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="97" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">The construction documents shall provide details of the exterior wall envelope as required, including flashing, intersections with dissimilar materials, corners, end details, control joints, intersections at roof, eaves or parapets, means of drainage, water-resistive barrier and details around openings.</source>
<target xml:space="preserve"></target>
