<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="154" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">In flood hazard areas, upon placement of the lowest floor, including the basement, and prior to further vertical construction, the elevation certification required in Section 1612.4 or the International Residential Code, as applicable, shall be submitted to the building official.</source>
