<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="156" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">Framing inspections shall be made after the roof deck or sheathing, all framing, fire-blocking and bracing are in place and pipes, chimneys and vents to be concealed are complete and the rough electrical, plumbing, heating wires, pipes and ducts are approved.</source>
