<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="186" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">A building or structure shall not be used or occupied in whole or in part, and a change of occupancy of a building or structure or portion thereof shall not be made, until the building official has issued a certificate of occupancy therefor as provided herein.</source>
