<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="203" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">The building official is authorized to issue a temporary certificate of occupancy before the completion of the entire work covered by the permit, provided that such portion or portions shall be occupied safely.</source>
<target xml:space="preserve"></target>
