<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="205" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">The building official is authorized to suspend or revoke a certificate of occupancy or completion issued under the provisions of this code, in writing, wherever the certificate is issued in error, or on the basis of incorrect information supplied, or where it is determined that the building or structure or portion thereof is in violation of the provisions of this code or other ordinance of the jurisdiction.</source>
<target xml:space="preserve"></target>
