<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="223" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">Any person who shall continue any work after having been served with a stop work order, except such work as that person is directed to perform to remove a violation or unsafe condition, shall be subject to fines established by the authority having jurisdiction</source>
