<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="263" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">Owner-occupied lodging houses with five or fewer guest rooms and 10 or fewer total occupants shall be permitted to be constructed in accordance with the International Residential Code, provided that an automatic sprinkler system is installed in accordance with Section 903.3.1.3 or Section P2904 of the International Residential Code.</source>
<target xml:space="preserve"></target>
<context-group>
