<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="277" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">This occupancy condition shall include buildings in which there are any persons receiving custodial care who require limited verbal or physical assistance while responding to an emergency situation to complete building evacuation.</source>
