<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="319" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">Any other wall materials that provide impact resistance equivalent to that required by Sections 403.2.2.1 for Soft Body Impact Classification Level 2 and 403.2.2.2 for Hard Body Impact Classification Level 3, as measured by the test method described in ASTM C1629/C1629M, shall be permitted.</source>
