<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="354" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">In Group R-1 occupancies, each sleeping unit or suite having an exterior wall shall be permitted to be provided with 2 square feet (0.19 m2) of venting area in lieu of the area specified in Item 1.</source>
