<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="392" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">Stairway doors that are locked from the stairway side shall be capable of being unlocked simultaneously without unlatching upon a signal from the fire command center.</source>
<target xml:space="preserve"></target>
