<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="428" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">Atrium spaces shall be separated from adjacent spaces by a 1-hour fire barrier constructed in accordance with Section 707 or a horizontal assembly constructed in accordance with Section 711, or both.</source>
