<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="484" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">Smoke control in accordance with Section 909 shall be provided to maintain the smoke layer interface not less than 6 feet (1829 mm) above the highest level of the assembly seating or above the top of the proscenium opening where a proscenium wall is provided in compliance with Section 410.2.4.</source>
