<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="494" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">Dressing rooms, scene docks, property rooms, workshops, storerooms and compartments appurtenant to the stage shall be separated from each other by not less than 1-hour fire barriers constructed in accordance with Section 707 or horizontal assemblies constructed in accordance with Section 711, or both.</source>
