<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="523" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">Sprinklers are not required under stage areas less than 4 feet (1219 mm) in clear height that are utilized exclusively for storage of tables and chairs, provided that the concealed space is separated from the adjacent spaces by Type X gypsum board not less than 5/8-inch (15.9 mm) in thickness.</source>
