<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="539" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">Fire alarm systems and smoke alarms shall be provided in Group I-1, R- 1 and R-2 occupancies in accordance with Sections 907.2.6, 907.2.8 and 907.2.9, respectively.</source>
