<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="539" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">Single- or multiple-station smoke alarms shall be provided in Groups I-1, R-2, R-3 and R-4 in accordance with Section 907.2.11.<ph id="1">&lt;/rpr id=&quot;5&quot; transform=&quot;close&quot;&gt;</ph></source>
