<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="552" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">In Group I-1, Condition 1, the corridors onto which the spaces open are protected by an automatic fire detection system installed in accordance with Section 907, or the spaces are equipped throughout with quick-response sprinklers in accordance with Section 903.3.2.</source>
