<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="578" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">The types of domestic cooking appliances shall be limited to ovens, cooktops, ranges, warmers, coffee makers and microwaves.</source>
<target xml:space="preserve"></target>
