<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="595" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">An occupied roof shall not be included in the building height or number of stories as regulated by Section 504, provided that the penthouses and other enclosed rooftop structures comply with Section 1511.</source>
