<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="597" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">Emergency voice/alarm communication system notification per Section 907.5.2.2 shall also be provided in the area of the occupied roof where such system is required elsewhere in the building.</source>
