<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="612" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">Smoke-barrier walls used to enclose areas of refuge in accordance with Section 1009.6.4 or to enclose elevator lobbies in accordance with Section 405.4.3, 3007.6.2, or 3008.6.2 shall comply with Section 709.4.2.</source>
