<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="613" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">Smoke-barrier walls are not required in interstitial spaces where such spaces are designed and constructed with ceilings or exterior walls that provide resistance to the passage of fire and smoke equivalent to that provided by the smoke-barrier walls.</source>
