<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="615" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">Smoke-barrier assemblies used to separate smoke compartments shall form an effective membrane enclosure that is continuous from an outside wall or smoke barrier wall to an outside wall or another smoke barrier wall and to the horizontal assemblies.</source>
