<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="621" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">In Group I-1, Condition 2, Group I-2 and ambulatory care facilities, where a pair of opposite-swinging doors are installed across a corridor in accordance with Section 709.5.1, the doors shall not be required to be protected in accordance with Section 716.</source>
<target xml:space="preserve"></target>
