<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="621" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">The doors shall be close fitting within operational tolerances, and shall not have a center mullion or undercuts in excess of 3/4 inch (19.1 mm), louvers or grilles.</source>
