<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="624" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">In Group I-2 and ambulatory care facilities, where doors protecting openings in smoke barriers are installed across a corridor and have hold-open devices, the doors shall be automatic-closing in accordance with Section 716.2.6.6.</source>
