<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="651" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">Where required elsewhere in the code, doors in smoke partitions shall meet the requirements for a smoke and draft control door assembly tested in accordance with UL 1784.</source>
