<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="651" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">The air leakage rate of the door assembly shall not exceed 3.0 cubic feet per minute per square foot [0.015424 m3/(s × m2)] of door opening at 0.10 inch (24.9 Pa) of water for both the ambient temperature test and the elevated temperature exposure test.</source>
