<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="693" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">Horizontal assemblies separating dwelling units and sleeping units shall be not less than 1/2-hour fire-resistance-rated construction in a building of Types IIB, IIIB and VB construction, where the building is equipped throughout with an automatic sprinkler system in accordance with Section 903.3.1.1.</source>
