<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="770" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">Access doors shall be permitted in ceilings of fire-resistance-rated floor/ceiling and roof/ceiling assemblies, provided that such doors are tested in accordance with ASTM E119 or UL 263 as horizontal assemblies and labeled by an approved agency for such purpose.</source>
