<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="774" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">Skylights and other penetrations through a fire-resistance-rated roof deck or slab are permitted to be unprotected, provided that the structural integrity of the fire-resistance-rated roof assembly is maintained.</source>
