<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="786" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">For buildings in flood hazard areas as established in Section 1612.3, interior finishes, trim and decorative materials below the elevation required by Section 1612 shall be flood-damage-resistant materials.</source>
