<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="812" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">Combustible materials installed on or embedded in floors of buildings of Type I or II construction shall comply with Sections 805.1.1 through 805.1.3.</source>
<target xml:space="preserve"></target>
<context-group>
