<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="837" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">Occupancy-based requirements for combustible decorative materials, other than decorative vegetation, not complying with Section 806.4 shall comply with Sections 807.5.1 through 807.5.6 of the International Fire Code.</source>
<target xml:space="preserve"></target>
