<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="845" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">Material, other than foam plastic used as interior trim, shall have a minimum Class C flame spread and smoke-developed index when tested in accordance with ASTM E84 or UL 723, as described in Section 803.1.2.</source>
<target xml:space="preserve"></target>
