<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="861" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">Acoustical materials complying with the interior finish requirements of Section 803 shall be installed in accordance with the manufacturer's recommendations and applicable provisions for applying interior finish.</source>
