<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="865" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">Acoustical ceiling systems that are part of fire-resistance-rated construction shall be installed in the same manner used in the assembly tested and shall comply with the provisions of Chapter 7.</source>
