<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="871" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">Alternative automatic fire-extinguishing systems complying with Section 904 shall be permitted instead of automatic sprinkler protection where recognized by the applicable standard and approved by the fire code official.</source>
