<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="999" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">Where a rubbish chute extends through a building more than one floor below the lowest intake, the extension shall have sprinklers installed that are recessed from the drop area of the chute and protected from freezing in accordance with Section 903.3.1.1.</source>
<target xml:space="preserve"></target>
