<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="1015" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">Shop drawings for fire alarm systems shall be prepared in accordance with NFPA 72 and submitted for review and approval prior to system installation.</source>
<target xml:space="preserve"></target>
