<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="1061" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">A manual fire alarm system that activates the occupant notification system in accordance with Section 907.5 shall be installed in Group H-5 occupancies and in occupancies used for the manufacture of organic coatings.</source>
