<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="1061" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">An automatic smoke detection system shall be installed for highly toxic gases, organic peroxides and oxidizers in accordance with Chapters 60, 62 and 63, respectively, of the International Fire Code.</source>
