<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="1063" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">An automatic smoke detection system that activates the occupant notification system in accordance with Section 907.5 shall be provided in accordance with Sections 907.2.6.1, 907.2.6.2 and 907.2.6.3.3.</source>
