<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="1066" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">Occupant notification systems are not required to be activated where private mode signaling installed in accordance with NFPA 72 is approved by the fire code official and staff evacuation responsibilities are included in the fire safety and evacuation plan required by Section 404 of the International Fire Code.</source>
