<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="1068" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">In Group I-1 occupancies, an automatic smoke detection system shall be installed in corridors, waiting areas open to corridors and habitable spaces other than sleeping units and kitchens.</source>
