<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="1070" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">For Group I-1, Condition 1 occupancies, smoke detection in habitable spaces is not required where the facility is equipped throughout with an automatic sprinkler system installed in accordance with Section 903.3.1.1.</source>
