<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="1075" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject"><bpt id="1" ctype="bold">{}</bpt>Carbon monoxide detection shall be installed in new buildings in accordance with Sections 915.1.1 <ept id="1">{}</ept>through 915.6.</source>
