<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="1079" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">Carbon monoxide detection shall be provided in dwelling units, sleeping units and classrooms that contain a fuel-burning appliance or a fuel-burning fireplace.</source>
