<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="1082" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">Carbon monoxide detection shall not be required in dwelling units, sleeping units and classrooms if a carbon monoxide detector is provided in the first room or area served by each main duct leaving the furnace, and the carbon monoxide alarm signals are automatically transmitted to an approved location.</source>
