<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="1110" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">Carbon monoxide detection required by Sections 915.1 through 915.2.3 shall be provided by carbon monoxide alarms complying with Section 915.4 or carbon monoxide detection systems complying with Section 915.5.</source>
