<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="1114" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">Carbon monoxide alarms shall receive their primary power from the building wiring where such wiring is served from a commercial source, and when primary power is interrupted, shall receive power from a battery.</source>
