<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="1155" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">1.<ph id="1">&lt;mq:ch val=&quot;	&quot; /&gt;</ph>For flammable gases, a gas concentration exceeding 25 percent of the lower flammability limit (LFL).</source>
<target xml:space="preserve"></target>
