<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="1156" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">2.<ph id="1">&lt;mq:ch val=&quot;	&quot; /&gt;</ph>For nonflammable gases, a gas concentration exceeding one-half of the IDLH, unless a different threshold is specified by the section of this code requiring a gas detection system.</source>
