<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="1167" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">Prior to construction of a new building requiring a fire alarm system on a multiple-building college or university campus having a cumulative building occupant load of 1,000 or more, a mass notification risk analysis shall be conducted in accordance with NFPA 72.</source>
<target xml:space="preserve"></target>
<context-group>
