<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="1187" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">In buildings where a required accessible floor or occupied roof is four or more stories above or below a level of exit discharge, not less than one required accessible means of egress shall be an elevator complying with Section 1009.4.</source>
