<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="1215" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">Ramps used as part of a means of egress shall have a running slope not steeper than 1 unit vertical in 12 units horizontal (8.3-percent slope).</source>
<target xml:space="preserve"></target>
