<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="1261" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">Barriers shall be constructed so that the barrier prevents the passage of a 4-inch-diameter (102 mm) sphere, where any portion of the sphere is within 4 inches (102 mm) of the floor or ground surface.</source>
