<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="1267" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">Aisles or aisle accessways shall be provided from all occupied portions of the exit access that contain seats, tables, furnishings, displays and similar fixtures or equipment.</source>
