<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="1332" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">Openings in interior exit stairways and ramps other than unprotected exterior openings shall be limited to those required for exit access to the enclosure from normally occupied spaces and for egress from the enclosure.</source>
