<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="1346" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">Equipment and ductwork for interior exit stairway and ramp ventilation as permitted by Section 1023.5 shall comply with one of the following items:</source>
<target xml:space="preserve"></target>
<context-group>
