<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="1349" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">3.<ph id="1">&lt;mq:ch val=&quot;	&quot; /&gt;</ph>Where located within the building, such equipment and ductwork shall be separated from the remainder of the building, including other mechanical equipment, with construction as required for shafts.</source>
