<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="1357" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">The signage shall state the story of and direction to the exit discharge, and the availability of roof access from the interior exit stairway and ramp for the fire department.</source>
<target xml:space="preserve"></target>
<context-group>
