<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="1357" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">The bottom of the sign shall be located not less than 5 feet (1524 mm) above the floor landing in a position that is readily visible when the doors are in the open and closed positions.</source>
