<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="1365" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">6.<ph id="1">&lt;mq:ch val=&quot;	&quot; /&gt;</ph>Where signs required by Section 1023.9 are installed in the interior exit stairways and ramps of buildings subject to Section 1025, the signs shall be made of the same materials as required by Section 1025.4.</source>
