<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="1369" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">Where floor level signs are provided in interior exit stairways and ramps, a floor-level sign identifying the floor level in visual characters, raised characters and braille complying with ICC A117.1 shall be located at each floor-level landing adjacent to the door leading from the interior exit stairway and ramp into the corridor.</source>
