<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="1373" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">The exit passageway shall be separated from the remainder of the building by 2-hour fire barriers constructed in accordance with Section 707 or horizontal assemblies constructed in accordance with Section 711, or both.</source>
