<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="1397" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">Where an interior exit stairway or ramp is extended to an exit discharge or a public way by an exit passageway, the exit passageway shall comply with Section 1023.3.1.</source>
