<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="1417" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">This construction shall extend vertically from the ground to a point 10 feet (3048 mm) above the floor of the exit passageway, or to the roof line, whichever is lower.</source>
