<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="1423" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">Approved luminous egress path markings delineating the exit path shall be provided in high-rise buildings of Group A, B, E, I-1, M or R-1 occupancies in accordance with this section.</source>
