<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="1424" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">Luminous egress path markings shall not be required on the level of exit discharge in lobbies that serve as part of the exit path in accordance with Section 1028.2, Exception 1.</source>
