<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="1426" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">Egress path markings shall be provided in interior exit stairways, interior exit ramps and exit passageways, in accordance with Sections 1025.2.1 through 1025.2.6.3.</source>
