<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="1428" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">The leading edge of the stripe shall be placed not more than 1/2 inch (12.7 mm) from the leading edge of the step and the stripe shall not overlap the leading edge of the step by not more than 1/2 inch (12.7 mm) down the vertical face of the step.</source>
