<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="1439" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">Perimeter demarcation lines shall be placed within 4 inches (102 mm) of the wall and shall extend to within 2 inches (51 mm) of the markings on the leading edge of landings.</source>
