<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="1456" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">The top and sides of the door frame shall be marked with a solid and continuous 1-inch-to 2-inch-wide (25 mm to 51 mm) stripe.</source>
