<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="1507" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">The entire area of the vestibule is separated from areas below by construction conforming to the fire-resistance rating of the interior exit stairway or ramp enclosure.</source>
<target xml:space="preserve"></target>
<context-group>
