<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="1543" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">Spaces under grandstands or bleachers shall be separated by fire barriers complying with Section 707 and horizontal assemblies complying with Section 711 with not less than 1-hour fire-resistance-rated construction.</source>
