<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="1563" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">4.<ph id="1">&lt;mq:ch val=&quot;	&quot; /&gt;</ph>Ramped aisles, where slopes are steeper than one unit vertical in 12 units horizontal (8-percent slope), shall have not less than 0.22 inch (5.6 mm) of clear aisle capacity for each occupant served.</source>
