<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="1563" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">Level or ramped aisles, where slopes are not steeper than one unit vertical in 12 units horizontal (8-percent slope), shall have not less than 0.20 inch (5.1 mm) of clear aisle capacity for each occupant served.</source>
