<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="1565" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">The required capacity in inches (mm) of the aisle for smoke-protected assembly seating shall be not less than the occupant load served by the egress element multiplied by the appropriate factor in Table 1030.6.2.</source>
