<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="1603" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">A smoke-protected assembly seating area with a roof shall have the lowest portion of the roof deck not less than 15 feet (4572 mm) above the highest aisle or aisle accessway.</source>
