<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="1661" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">Each end of an aisle shall be continuous to a cross aisle, foyer, doorway, vomitory, concourse or stairway in accordance with Section 1030.9.7 having access to an exit.</source>
