<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="1703" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">Outdoor aisles, stepped aisles and ramped aisles and outdoor approaches to aisles, stepped aisles and ramped aisles shall be designed so that water will not accumulate on the walking surface.</source>
