<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="1707" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">Where seating is located at a table or counter and is adjacent to an aisle or aisle accessway, the measurement of required clear width of the aisle or aisle accessway shall be made to a line 19 inches (483 mm) away from and parallel to the edge of the table or counter.</source>
<target xml:space="preserve"></target>
<context-group>
