<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="1707" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">In the case of other side boundaries for aisles or aisle accessways, the clear width shall be measured to walls, edges of seating and tread edges.</source>
<target xml:space="preserve"></target>
