<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="1718" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">The minimum clear width of 12 inches (305 mm) between rows shall be increased by 0.3 inch (7.6 mm) for every additional seat beyond 14 seats where seats have backrests or beyond 21 where seats are without backrests.</source>
