<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="1779" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">The slope measured perpendicular to the direction of travel of a ramped aisle shall not be steeper than 1 unit vertical in 48 units horizontal (2-percent slope).</source>
