<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="1784" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">In assembly spaces with fixed seating, edge protection is not required on the sides of ramped aisles where the ramped aisles provide access to the adjacent seating and aisle accessways.</source>
