<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="1786" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">Aisles with a slope exceeding one unit vertical in eight units horizontal (12.5-percent slope) shall consist of a series of risers and treads that extends across the full width of aisles and complies with Sections 1030.14.2.1 through 1030.14.2.4.</source>
