<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="1791" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">Where the gradient of stepped aisles is to be the same as the gradient of adjoining seating areas, the riser height shall be not less than 4 inches (102 mm) nor more than 8 inches (203 mm) and shall be uniform within each flight.</source>
