<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="1816" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">3.<ph id="1">&lt;mq:ch val=&quot;	&quot; /&gt;</ph>Handrail extensions are not required at the top and bottom of stepped aisles and ramped aisles to permit crossovers within the aisles.</source>
