<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="1820" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">Handrails located on the side of stepped aisles shall return to a wall, guard or the walking surface or shall be continuous to the handrail of an adjacent stepped aisle flight.</source>
<target xml:space="preserve"></target>
