<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="1823" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">Mid-aisle handrails shall be permitted to extend beyond the lowest riser where the handrail extensions do not obstruct the width of the cross aisle.</source>
<target xml:space="preserve"></target>
