<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="1827" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">Guards adjacent to seating in a building, room or space used for assembly purposes shall be provided where required by Section 1015 and shall be constructed in accordance with Section 1015 except where provided in accordance with Sections 1030.17.1 through 1030.17.4.</source>
