<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="1827" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">At bleachers, grandstands and folding and telescopic seating, guards must be provided where required by ICC 300 and Section 1030.17.1.</source>
<target xml:space="preserve"></target>
