<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="1831" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">1.<ph id="1">&lt;mq:ch val=&quot;	&quot; /&gt;</ph>Guards that impact sightlines shall be permitted to comply with Section 1030.17.3.</source>
