<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="1832" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">2.<ph id="1">&lt;mq:ch val=&quot;	&quot; /&gt;</ph>Bleachers, grandstands and folding and telescopic seating shall not be required to have perimeter guards where the seating is located adjacent to a wall and the space between the wall and the seating is less than 4 inches (102 mm).</source>
