<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="1840" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">The fascia or railing shall be not less than 36 inches (914 mm) high and shall provide not less than 42 inches (1067 mm) measured diagonally between the top of the rail and the nosing of the nearest tread.</source>
