<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="1849" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">Where basements contain one or more sleeping rooms, an emergency escape and rescue opening shall be required in each sleeping room, but shall not be required in adjoining areas of the basement.</source>
