<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="1872" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">An emergency escape and rescue opening with the bottom of the clear opening below the adjacent grade shall be provided with an area well in accordance with Sections 1031.5.1 through 1031.5.3.</source>
