<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="1874" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">The minimum horizontal area of the area well shall be 9 square feet (0.84 m2), with a horizontal projection and width of not less than 36 inches (914 mm).</source>
