<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="1879" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">Ladders or rungs shall have an inside width of at least 12 inches (305 mm), shall project at least 3 inches (76 mm) from the wall and shall be spaced not more than 18 inches (457 mm) on center (o.c.) vertically for the full height of the area well.</source>
