<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="1884" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">A drainage system for area wells is not required where the foundation is on well-drained soil or sand-gravel mixture soils in accordance with the United Soil Classification System, Group I Soils, in accordance with Section 1803.5.1.</source>
