<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="1901" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">Spaces and elements within employee work areas shall only be required to comply with Sections 907.5.2.3.1, 1009 and 1104.3.1 and shall be designed and constructed so that individuals with disabilities can approach, enter and exit the work area.</source>
