<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="1911" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">Raised areas used primarily for purposes of security, life safety or fire safety including, but not limited to, observation galleries, prison guard towers, fire towers or lifeguard stands are not required to comply with this chapter.</source>
