<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="1915" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">Raised or lowered areas, or portions of areas, in places of religious worship that are less than 300 square feet (30 m2) in area and located 7 inches (178 mm) or more above or below the finished floor and used primarily for the performance of religious ceremonies are not required to comply with this chapter.</source>
