<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="1975" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">Where security barriers incorporate elements that cannot comply with these requirements, such as certain metal detectors, fluoroscopes or other similar devices, the accessible route shall be permitted to be provided adjacent to security screening devices.</source>
