<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="2015" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">Dwelling units and sleeping units that are required to be Accessible units, Type A units and Type B units shall comply with the applicable portions of Chapter 11 of ICC A117.1.</source>
