<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="2017" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">Accessible spaces shall include toilet and bathing rooms, kitchen, living and dining areas and any exterior spaces, including patios, terraces and balconies.</source>
<target xml:space="preserve"></target>
