<trans-unit id="2463" mq:status="NotStarted" mq:segmentguid="a1b10cb3-9ee1-44ad-96b5-118a035cd0c1" mq:lastchangedtimestamp="0001-01-01T00:00:00Z" mq:maxlengthchars="-1" mq:nosplitjoin="false" mq:firstlabel="2025" mq:lastlabel="2025" mq:autosplitjoinstate="0" mq:lastmodifrole="0" mq:multipleexactmatch="false">
<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="2025" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">If due to circumstances outside the control of the owner, either the slope of the finished ground level between accessible facilities and buildings exceeds one unit vertical in 12 units horizontal (1:12), or where physical barriers or legal restrictions prevent the installation of an accessible route, a vehicular route with parking that complies with Section 1106 at each public or common use facility or building is permitted in place of the accessible route.</source>
<target xml:space="preserve"></target>
<context-group>
<context context-type="x-mmq-structural-context">trans-units / trans-unit#5982 / struct-rpr#1</context>
</context-group>
<mq:startingws xml:space="preserve" />
<mq:endingws xml:space="preserve" />
<mq:commitinfos xmlns="MQXliff" /><mq:nosplitjoins />
<mq:originalsource edited="false" />
</trans-unit>
<trans-unit id="2464" mq:status="NotStarted" mq:segmentguid="523a1759-5660-4720-89f4-fb97df1ce58a" mq:lastchangedtimestamp="0001-01-01T00:00:00Z" mq:maxlengthchars="-1" mq:nosplitjoin="false" mq:firstlabel="2026" mq:lastlabel="2026" mq:autosplitjoinstate="0" mq:lastmodifrole="0" mq:multipleexactmatch="false">
<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="2026" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">In Group I-3 facilities, an accessible route is not required to connect stories or mezzanines where Accessible units, all common use areas serving Accessible units and all public use areas are on an accessible route.</source>
<target xml:space="preserve"></target>
<context-group>
<context context-type="x-mmq-structural-context">trans-units / trans-unit#5983 / struct-rpr#1</context>
</context-group>
<mq:startingws xml:space="preserve" />
<mq:endingws xml:space="preserve" />
<mq:commitinfos xmlns="MQXliff" /><mq:nosplitjoins />
<mq:originalsource edited="false" />
</trans-unit>
<trans-unit id="2465" mq:status="NotStarted" mq:segmentguid="5ab670fd-4705-4eed-8b24-2dbed6527a5e" mq:lastchangedtimestamp="0001-01-01T00:00:00Z" mq:maxlengthchars="-1" mq:nosplitjoin="false" mq:firstlabel="2027" mq:lastlabel="2027" mq:autosplitjoinstate="0" mq:lastmodifrole="0" mq:multipleexactmatch="false">
<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="2027" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">In Group R-2 facilities with Type A units complying with Section 1108.6.2.2.1, an accessible route is not required to connect stories or mezzanines where Type A units, all common use areas serving Type A units and all public use areas are on an accessible route.</source>
<target xml:space="preserve"></target>
<context-group>
<context context-type="x-mmq-structural-context">trans-units / trans-unit#5984 / struct-rpr#1</context>
</context-group>
<mq:startingws xml:space="preserve" />
<mq:endingws xml:space="preserve" />
<mq:commitinfos xmlns="MQXliff" /><mq:nosplitjoins />
<mq:originalsource edited="false" />
</trans-unit>
<trans-unit id="2466" mq:status="NotStarted" mq:segmentguid="b71dc929-2a88-4dee-8ede-f022fba158e0" mq:lastchangedtimestamp="0001-01-01T00:00:00Z" mq:maxlengthchars="-1" mq:nosplitjoin="false" mq:firstlabel="2028" mq:lastlabel="2028" mq:autosplitjoinstate="0" mq:lastmodifrole="0" mq:multipleexactmatch="false">
<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="2028" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">In other than Group R-2 dormitory housing provided by places of education, in Group R-2 facilities with Accessible units complying with Section 1108.6.2.3.1, an accessible route is not required to connect stories or mezzanines where Accessible units, all common use areas serving Accessible units and all public use areas are on an accessible route.</source>
<target xml:space="preserve"></target>
<context-group>
<context context-type="x-mmq-structural-context">trans-units / trans-unit#5985 / struct-rpr#1</context>
</context-group>
<mq:startingws xml:space="preserve" />
<mq:endingws xml:space="preserve" />
<mq:commitinfos xmlns="MQXliff" /><mq:nosplitjoins />
<mq:originalsource edited="false" />
</trans-unit>
<trans-unit id="2467" mq:status="NotStarted" mq:segmentguid="eeee0641-9830-443b-b485-658a62a43863" mq:lastchangedtimestamp="0001-01-01T00:00:00Z" mq:maxlengthchars="-1" mq:nosplitjoin="false" mq:firstlabel="2029" mq:lastlabel="2029" mq:autosplitjoinstate="0" mq:lastmodifrole="0" mq:multipleexactmatch="false">
<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="2029" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">In Group R-1, an accessible route is not required to connect stories or mezzanines within individual units, provided the accessible level meets the provisions for Accessible units and sleeping accommodations for two persons minimum and a toilet facility are provided on that level.</source>
<target xml:space="preserve"></target>
<context-group>
<context context-type="x-mmq-structural-context">trans-units / trans-unit#5986 / struct-rpr#1</context>
</context-group>
<mq:startingws xml:space="preserve" />
<mq:endingws xml:space="preserve" />
<mq:commitinfos xmlns="MQXliff" /><mq:nosplitjoins />
<mq:originalsource edited="false" />
</trans-unit>
<trans-unit id="2468" mq:status="NotStarted" mq:segmentguid="b070b7a4-7b35-418a-9fc2-48d819fcb950" mq:lastchangedtimestamp="0001-01-01T00:00:00Z" mq:maxlengthchars="-1" mq:nosplitjoin="false" mq:firstlabel="2030" mq:lastlabel="2030" mq:autosplitjoinstate="0" mq:lastmodifrole="0" mq:multipleexactmatch="false">
<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="2030" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">In congregate residences in Groups R-3 and R-4, an accessible route is not required to connect stories or mezzanines where Accessible units or Type B units, all common use areas serving Accessible units and Type B units and all public use areas serving Accessible units and Type B units are on an accessible route.</source>
<target xml:space="preserve"></target>
<context-group>
