<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="2077" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">In addition to the Accessible units required by Section 1108.5.5.1, where special holding cells or special housing cells or rooms are provided, at least one serving each purpose shall be an Accessible unit.</source>
