<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="2077" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">Cells or rooms subject to this requirement include, but are not limited to, those used for purposes of orientation, protective custody, administrative or disciplinary detention or segregation, detoxification and medical isolation.</source>
