<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="2086" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">On a multiple-building site, where structures contain 50 or fewer dwelling units or sleeping units, all dwelling units and sleeping units on a site shall be considered to determine the total number of Accessible units.</source>
