<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="2156" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">Where the bedrooms are grouped into dwelling or sleeping units, only one bedroom in each dwelling or sleeping unit shall be permitted to count toward the number of required Accessible units.</source>
