<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="2194" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">Type A units and Type B units shall not be required for buildings without elevator service that are located in flood hazard areas as established in Section 1612.3, where the minimum required elevation of the lowest floor or lowest supporting horizontal structural member, as applicable, results in all of the following:</source>
