<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="2195" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">A difference in elevation between the minimum required floor elevation at the primary entrances and vehicular and pedestrian arrival points within 50 feet (15 240 mm) exceeding 30 inches (762 mm).</source>
