<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="2196" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">A slope exceeding 10 percent between the minimum required floor elevation at the primary entrances and vehicular and pedestrian arrival points within 50 feet (15 240 mm).</source>
