<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="2200" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">Where a floor level is not required to be connected by an <bpt id="1" ctype="italic">{}</bpt>accessible route<ept id="1">{}</ept>, the only toilet rooms or bathing rooms provided within the facility shall not be located on the inaccessible floor.</source>
