<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="2206" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">Toilet rooms or bathing rooms that are part of critical care or intensive care patient sleeping rooms serving Accessible units are not required to be accessible.</source>
<target xml:space="preserve"></target>
