<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="2216" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">A single drinking fountain with two separate spouts that complies with the requirements for people who use a wheelchair and standing persons shall be permitted to be substituted for two separate drinking fountains.</source>
