<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="2217" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">Where drinking fountains are primarily for children’s use, drinking fountains for people using wheelchairs shall be permitted to comply with the children’s provisions in ICC A117.1 and drinking fountains for standing children shall be permitted.</source>
