<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="2243" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">Where drinking fountains for persons using wheelchairs and drinking fountains for standing persons are not located adjacent to each other, directional signage shall be provided indicating the location of the other drinking fountains.</source>
