<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="2247" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">Where ticket offices or windows are provided, signs are not required at each assembly area provided that signs are displayed at each ticket office or window informing patrons of the availability of assistive listening systems.</source>
