<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="2248" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">At each door to an area of refuge providing direct access to a stairway, exterior area for assisted rescue, exit stairway, exit passageway or exit discharge, signage shall be provided in accordance with Section 1013.4.</source>
