<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="2253" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">In addition, where accessible unload areas also serve as accessible load areas, signs indicating the location of the accessible load and unload areas shall be provided at entries to queues and waiting lines.</source>
