<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="2268" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">Where rooms and spaces without openings to the outdoors are ventilated through an adjoining room, the opening to the adjoining room shall be unobstructed and shall have an area of not less than 8 percent of the floor area of the interior room or space, but not less than 25 square feet (2.3 m2).</source>
<target xml:space="preserve"></target>
