<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="2269" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">Exterior openings required for ventilation shall be allowed to open into a sunroom with thermal isolation or a patio cover provided that the openable area between the sunroom addition or patio cover and the interior room shall have an area of not less than 8 percent of the floor area of the interior room or space, but not less than 20 square feet (1.86 m2).</source>
<target xml:space="preserve"></target>
