<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="2271" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">Where openings below grade provide required natural ventilation, the outside horizontal clear space measured perpendicular to the opening shall be one and one-half times the depth of the opening.</source>
<target xml:space="preserve"></target>
