<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="2288" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">The sound transmission class of concrete masonry and clay masonry assemblies shall be calculated in accordance with TMS 302 or determined through testing in accordance with ASTM E90.</source>
