<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="2290" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">Floor-ceiling assemblies between dwelling units and sleeping units or between a dwelling unit or sleeping unit and a public or service area within the structure shall have an impact insulation class rating of not less than 50 where tested in accordance with ASTM E492, or have a Normalized Impact Sound Rating (NISR) of not less than 45 if field tested in accordance with ASTM E1007.</source>
<target xml:space="preserve"></target>
<context-group>
<context context-type="x-mmq-structural-context">trans-units / trans-unit#6384 / struct-rpr#1</context>
</context-group>
