<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="2299" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">Any portion of the room measuring less than 5 feet (1524 mm) from the finished floor to the ceiling shall not be included in any computation of the minimum area thereof.</source>
