<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="2341" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">The walls or partitions shall begin at a height not more than 12 inches (305 mm) from and extend not less than 60 inches (1524 mm) above the finished floor surface.</source>
