<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="2341" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">The walls or partitions shall extend from the wall surface at each side of the urinal not less than 18 inches (457 mm) or to a point not less than 6 inches (152 mm) beyond the outermost front lip of the urinal measured from the finished backwall surface, whichever is greater.</source>
