<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="2362" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject"><ph id="1">&lt;/rpr id=&quot;9&quot; transform=&quot;close&quot;&gt;</ph><bpt id="2" rid="1">&lt;rpr id=&quot;5&quot;&gt;</bpt>Where interior glazing is installed adjacent to a walking surface, the differential deflection of two adjacent unsupported edges shall be not greater than the thickness of the panels when a force of 50 pounds per linear foot (plf) (730 N/m) is applied horizontally to one panel at any point up to 42 inches (1067 mm) above the walking surface.<ept id="3" rid="1">&lt;/rpr id=&quot;5&quot; transform=&quot;close&quot;&gt;</ept></source>
