<mq:originalsource edited="true"><ph id="1">&lt;/rpr id=&quot;10&quot; transform=&quot;close&quot;&gt;</ph><bpt id="2" rid="1">&lt;rpr id=&quot;5&quot;&gt;</bpt>Glazing in an individual fixed or operable panel adjacent to a door where the nearest vertical edge of the glazing is within a 24-inch (610 mm) arc of either vertical edge of the door in a closed position and where the bottom exposed edge of the glazing is less than 60 inches (1524 mm) above the walking sur- face shall be considered to be a hazardous location.<ept id="3" rid="1">&lt;/rpr id=&quot;5&quot; transform=&quot;close&quot;&gt;</ept></mq:originalsource>
