<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="2467" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">The top rail or handrail shall be supported by not fewer than three glass baluster panels, or shall be otherwise supported to remain in place should one glass baluster panel fail.<ph id="1">&lt;/rpr id=&quot;5&quot; transform=&quot;close&quot;&gt;</ph></source>
