<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="2512" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">The symbol shall be not less than 3 inches (76 mm) in height and shall be placed inside on both sides of the hoistway door frame.<ph id="1">&lt;/rpr id=&quot;5&quot; transform=&quot;close&quot;&gt;</ph></source>
