<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="2553" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">1<ph id="1">&lt;mq:ch val=&quot;	&quot; /&gt;</ph>.The glazed areas need not be openable where the opening is not required by Section R310 and a whole-house mechanical ventilation system is installed in accordance with Section M1505.</source>
<target xml:space="preserve"></target>
