<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="2557" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">For the purpose of determining light and ventilation requirements, rooms shall be considered to be a portion of an adjoining room where not less than one-half of the area of the common wall is open and unobstructed and provides an opening of not less than one-tenth of the floor area of the interior room and not less than 25 square feet (2.3 m2).</source>
