<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="2560" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">Bathrooms, water closet compartments and other similar rooms shall be provided with aggregate glazing area in windows of not less than 3 square feet (0.3 m2), one-half of which shall be openable.</source>
