<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="2567" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">Mechanical and gravity outdoor air intake openings shall be located not less than 10 feet (3048 mm) from any hazardous or noxious contaminant, such as vents, chimneys, plumbing vents, streets, alleys, parking lots and loading docks.</source>
