<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="2585" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">1.Required glazed openings that face into a roofed porch where the porch abuts a street, yard or court and the longer side of the porch is not less than 65 percent unobstructed and the ceiling height is not less than 7 feet (2134 mm).</source>
