<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="2587" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">3.Required glazed openings that face into the area under a deck, balcony, bay or floor cantilever where a clear vertical space not less than 36 inches (914 mm) in height is provided.</source>
