<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="2589" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">Required glazed openings shall be permitted to open into sunroom additions or patio covers that abut a street, yard or court if in excess of 40 percent of the exterior sunroom walls are open, or are enclosed only by insect screening, and the ceiling height of the sunroom is not less than 7 feet (2134 mm).</source>
