<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="2638" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">Multipane assemblies having individual panes not exceeding 1 square foot (0.09 m2) in exposed area shall have not less than one pane in the assembly identified in accordance with Section R308.1.</source>
