<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="2640" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">Regular, float, wired or patterned glass in jalousies and louvered windows shall be not less than nominal 3/16 inch (5 mm) thick and not more than 48 inches (1219 mm) in length.</source>
