<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="2720" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">Glazing in guards and railings, including structural baluster panels and nonstructural in-fill panels, regardless of area or height above a walking surface shall be considered to be a hazardous location.</source>
