<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="2726" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">Glazing that is more than 60 inches (1524 mm), measured horizontally and in a straight line, from the water’s edge of a bathtub, hot tub, spa, whirlpool or swimming pool or from the edge of a shower, sauna or steam room.</source>
