<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="2730" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">1.<ph id="1">&lt;mq:ch val=&quot;	&quot; /&gt;</ph>Where glazing is adjacent to a walking surface and a horizontal rail is installed at 34 to 38 inches (864 to 965 mm) above the walking surface.</source>
