<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="2730" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">The rail shall be capable of withstanding a horizontal load of 50 pounds per linear foot (730 N/m) without contacting the glass and have a cross-sectional height of not less than 11/2 inches (38 mm).</source>
