<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="2740" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">The egress door shall be side-hinged, and shall provide a clear width of not less than 32 inches (813 mm) where measured between the face of the door and the stop, with the door open 90 degrees (1.57 rad).</source>
