<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="2747" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">Where exterior landings or floors serving the required egress door are not at grade, they shall be provided with access to grade by means of a ramp in accordance with Section R311.8 or a stairway in accordance with Section R311.7.</source>
<target xml:space="preserve"></target>
