<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="2754" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">Egress from habitable levels including habitable attics and basements that are not provided with an egress door in accordance with Section R311.2 shall be by a ramp in accordance with Section R311.8 or a stairway in accordance with Section R311.7.</source>
