<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="2756" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">Exterior landings, decks, balconies, stairs and similar facilities shall be positively anchored to the primary structure to resist both vertical and lateral forces or shall be designed to be self-supporting.</source>
