<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="2761" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">The clear width of stairways at and below the handrail height, including treads and landings, shall be not less than 311/2 inches (787 mm) where a handrail is installed on one side and 27 inches (698 mm) where handrails are installed on both sides.</source>
