<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="2766" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">1.<ph id="1">&lt;mq:ch val=&quot;	&quot; /&gt;</ph>Where the nosings of treads at the side of a flight extend under the edge of a floor opening through which the stair passes, the floor opening shall not project horizontally into the required headroom more than 43/4 inches (121 mm).</source>
<target xml:space="preserve"></target>
