<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="2775" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">Risers shall be vertical or sloped from the underside of the nosing of the tread above at an angle not more than 30 degrees (0.51 rad) from the vertical.</source>
