<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="2782" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">Winder treads shall have a tread depth of not less than 10 inches (254 mm) measured between the vertical planes of the foremost projection of adjacent treads at the intersections with the walkline.</source>
