<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="2782" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">Within any flight of stairs, the largest winder tread depth at the walkline shall not exceed the smallest winder tread by more than 3/8 inch (9.5 mm).</source>
