<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="2782" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">Consistently shaped winders at the walkline shall be allowed within the same flight of stairs as rectangular treads and shall not be required to be within 3/8 inch (9.5 mm) of the rectangular tread depth.</source>
