<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="2785" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">Nosings at treads, landings and floors of stairways shall have a radius of curvature at the nosing not greater than 9/16 inch (14 mm) or a bevel not greater than 1/2 inch (12.7 mm).</source>
