<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="2790" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">For landings of shapes other than square or rectangular, the depth at the walk line and the total area shall be not less than that of a quarter circle with a radius equal to the required landing width.</source>
