<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="2814" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">4.<ph id="1">&lt;mq:ch val=&quot;	&quot; /&gt;</ph><ph id="2">&lt;mq:ch val=&quot;	&quot; /&gt;</ph>Smoke alarms shall be installed not less than 3 feet (914 mm) horizontally from the door or opening of a bathroom that contains a bathtub or shower unless this would prevent placement of a smoke alarm required by this section.</source>
<target xml:space="preserve"></target>
<context-group>
