<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="2818" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">2.Ionization smoke alarms with an alarm-silencing switch shall not be installed less than 10 feet (3048 mm) horizontally from a permanently installed cooking appliance.</source>
