<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="2825" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">Smoke alarms shall receive their primary power from the building wiring where such wiring is served from a commercial source and, where primary power is interrupted, shall receive power from a battery.</source>
