<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="2861" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">Physical interconnection of carbon monoxide alarms shall not be required where listed wireless alarms are installed and all alarms sound upon activation of one alarm.</source>
<target xml:space="preserve"></target>
