<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="2862" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">Interconnection of carbon monoxide alarms in existing areas shall not be required where alterations or repairs do not result in removal of interior wall or ceiling finishes exposing the structure, unless there is an attic, crawl space or basement available that could provide access for interconnection without the removal of interior finishes.</source>
<target xml:space="preserve"></target>
