<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="2869" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">Carbon monoxide detection systems shall be permitted to be used in lieu of carbon monoxide alarms and shall comply with Sections R315.7.1 through R315.7.4.</source>
