<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="2887" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">Footings for masonry fireplaces and their chimneys shall be constructed of concrete or solid masonry not less than 12 inches (305 mm) thick and shall extend not less than 6 inches (152 mm) beyond the face of the fireplace or foundation wall on all sides.</source>
<target xml:space="preserve"></target>
