<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="2994" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">Smoke chamber walls shall be constructed of solid masonry units, hollow masonry units grouted solid, stone or concrete.</source>
<target xml:space="preserve"></target>
