<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="2994" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">Where a lining of firebrick not less than 2 inches (51 mm) thick, or a lining of vitrified clay not less than 5/8 inch (16 mm) thick, is provided, the total minimum thickness of front, back and side walls shall be 6 inches (152 mm) of solid masonry, including the lining.</source>
<target xml:space="preserve"></target>
