<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="2996" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">The inside surface of the smoke chamber shall not be inclined more than 45 degrees (0.79 rad) from vertical where prefabricated smoke chamber linings are used or where the smoke chamber walls are rolled or sloped rather than corbeled.</source>
<target xml:space="preserve"></target>
<context-group>
