<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="2996" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">Where the inside surface of the smoke chamber is formed by corbeled masonry, the walls shall not be corbeled more than 30 degrees (0.52 rad) from vertical.</source>
<target xml:space="preserve"></target>
<context-group>
