<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="2998" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">Masonry fireplace hearths and hearth extensions shall be constructed of concrete or masonry, supported by noncombustible materials, and reinforced to carry their own weight and all imposed loads.</source>
