<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="3003" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">Where the bottom of the firebox opening is raised not less than 8 inches (203 mm) above the top of the hearth extension, a hearth extension of not less than 3/8-inch-thick (10 mm) brick, concrete, stone, tile or other approved noncombustible material is permitted.</source>
