<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="3007" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">Wood beams, joists, studs and other combustible material shall have a clearance of not less than 2 inches (51 mm) from the front faces and sides of masonry fireplaces and not less than 4 inches (102 mm) from the back faces of masonry fireplaces.</source>
<target xml:space="preserve"></target>
<context-group>
