<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="3051" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject"><bpt id="1" ctype="bold">{}</bpt>Countertop spaces separated by range tops, refrigerators, or sinks shall be considered as separate countertop spaces in applying the requirements of Sections E3901.4.1, E3901.4.2 and E3901.4.3.<ph id="2">&lt;/rpr id=&quot;5&quot; transform=&quot;close&quot;&gt;</ph><ept id="1">{}</ept></source>
