<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="3056" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">Receptacles mounted below the countertop or work surface in accordance with this exception shall not be located where the countertop or work surface extends more than 6 inches (152 mm) beyond its support base.</source>
