<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="3105" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">The water supply to a bidet shall be protected against backflow by an air gap or backflow preventer in accordance with Section 608.14.1, 608.14.2, 608.14.3, 608.14.5, 608.14.6 or 608.14.8.</source>
