<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="3117" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">The waste connection of a residential dishwasher shall connect directly to a wye branch fitting on the tailpiece of the kitchen sink, directly to the dishwasher connection of a food waste disposer, or through an air break to a standpipe.</source>
