<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="3121" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">Prefabricated showers and shower compartments shall conform to ASME A112.19.1/CSA B45.2, ASME A112.19.2/CSA B45.1, ASME A112.19.3/CSA B45.4 or CSA B45.5/IAPMO Z124.</source>
