<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="3125" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">Waste outlets serving showers shall be not less than 11/2 inches (38 mm) in diameter and, for other than waste outlets in bathtubs, shall have removable strainers not less than 3 inches (76 mm) in diameter with strainer openings not less than 1/4 inch (6.4 mm) in least dimension.</source>
