<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="3129" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">Shower compartments shall be not less than 30 inches (762 mm) in least dimension as measured from the finished interior dimension of the compartment, exclusive of fixture valves, showerheads, soap dishes and safety grab bars or rails.</source>
