<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="3129" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">Except as required in Section 404, the minimum required area and dimension shall be measured from the finished interior dimension at a height equal to the top of the threshold and at a point tangent to its centerline and shall be continued to a height not less than 70 inches (1778 mm) above the shower drain outlet.</source>
