<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="3132" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">Bathtub floors, shower floors, wall areas above built-in tubs that have installed shower heads and walls in shower compartments shall be constructed of smooth, corrosion-resistant and nonabsorbent waterproof materials.</source>
