<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="3132" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">Wall materials shall extend to a height of not less than 6 feet (1829 mm) above the room floor level, and not less than 70 inches (1778 mm) above the drain of the tub or shower.</source>
