<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="3185" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">Where the manufacturer’s instructions do not specify the location and minimum size of field-fabricated access openings, an opening not less than 12 inches by 12 inches (305 mm by 305 mm) shall be installed to provide access to the circulation pump.</source>
