<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="3185" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">Where pumps are located more than 2 feet (609 mm) from the access opening, an opening not less than 18 inches by 18 inches (457 mm by 457 mm) shall be installed.</source>
