<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="3244" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">Where a door or gate is adjacent to a ramp landing, maneuvering clearances required by Sections 404.2.3 and 404.3.4 shall be permitted to overlap the landing area.</source>
