<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="3247" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">Ramps not subject to the exception to Section 405.5 shall be designed to maintain a 36-inch (915 mm) minimum clear width where handrails are installed.</source>
