<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="3253" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">Edge protection shall not be required on the sides of ramp landings having a vertical drop-off of 1/2 inch (13 mm) maximum within 10 inches (255 mm) horizontally of the minimum landing area specified in Section 405.7.</source>
<target xml:space="preserve"></target>
