<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="3350" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">For installations in existing buildings, elevator cars that provide a clear floor area of 15 square feet (1.4 m2) minimum, and provide a clear inside dimension of 36 inches (915 mm) minimum in width and 54 inches (1370 mm) minimum in depth, shall be permitted.</source>
