<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="3378" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">Hoistway doors or gates shall be permitted to be of the self-closing, manual type, where that door or gate provides access to a narrow end of the car that serves only one landing.</source>
