<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="3484" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">If provided, occupancy-sensing automatic controls shall activate the stairway lighting so the illuminance level required by Section 504.9.1 is provided on the entrance landing, each stair flight adjacent to the entrance landing, and on the landings above and below the entrance landing prior to any step being used.</source>
