<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="3486" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">Stair level identification signs in raised characters and braille complying with Sections 703.3 and 703.4 shall be located at each floor level landing in all enclosed stairways adjacent to the door leading from the stairwell into the corridor to identify the floor level.</source>
