<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="3510" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">Horizontal projections beyond the sides of the handrail occur 11/2 inches (38 mm) minimum below the bottom of the handrail, and provided that for each 1/2 inch (13 mm) of additional handrail perimeter dimension above 4 inches (100 mm), the vertical clearance dimension of 11/2 inch (38 mm) shall be permitted to be reduced by 1/8 inch (3.2 mm), and</source>
