<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="3512" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">Where handrails are provided along walking surfaces with slopes not steeper than 1:20, the bottoms of handrail gripping surfaces shall be permitted to be obstructed along their entire length where they are integral to crash rails or bumper guards.</source>
