<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="3538" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">Where operable windows are required to provide natural ventilation or operable windows are required to provide an emergency escape and rescue opening, that window shall be the operable window that complies with Section 506.</source>
