<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="3607" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">Alternate roll-in shower compartments shall have a clear inside dimension of 60 inches (1525 mm) minimum in width, and 36 inches (915 mm) in depth, measured at the center point of opposing sides.</source>
<target xml:space="preserve"></target>
