<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="3651" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">In transfer-type and alternate roll-in-type showers, the seat shall extend along the seat wall to a point within 3 inches (75 mm) of the compartment entry.</source>
