<mq:originalsource edited="true">Where pictograms are pro- vided as designations of permanent interior rooms and spaces, the pictograms shall comply with Section 703.5 and shall have text descriptors located directly below the pictogram field and complying with Sections 703.2 and 703.3.<ph id="1">&lt;/rpr id=&quot;5&quot; transform=&quot;close&quot;&gt;</ph></mq:originalsource>
</trans-unit>
