<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="3744" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">Pictograms that provide information about a room or space, such as “No Smoking”, occupant logos, and the International Symbol of Accessibility, are not required to have text descriptors.</source>
