<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="3778" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">In assembly seating where the maximum viewing distance is 100 feet (30.5 m) or greater, the spacing between the baselines of separate lines of characters within a message shall be permitted to be 120 percent minimum and 170 percent maximum of the character height.</source>
