<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="3800" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">Signs containing raised characters and braille shall be located so that a clear floor area 18 inches (455 mm) minimum by 18 inches (455 mm) minimum, centered on the raised characters is provided beyond the arc of any door swing between the closed position and 45 degree open position.<ph id="1">&lt;/rpr id=&quot;5&quot; transform=&quot;close&quot;&gt;</ph></source>
