<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="3879" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">Where armrests are provided on seating in the immediate area of designated aisle seats, folding or retractable armrests shall be provided on the aisle side of the designated aisle seat.</source>
