<trans-unit id="5128" mq:status="NotStarted" mq:segmentguid="c13f908c-eaa7-4868-bf38-642bf1a91090" mq:lastchangedtimestamp="0001-01-01T00:00:00Z" mq:maxlengthchars="-1" mq:nosplitjoin="false" mq:firstlabel="3943" mq:lastlabel="3943" mq:autosplitjoinstate="0" mq:lastmodifrole="0" mq:multipleexactmatch="false">
<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="3943" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject"><bpt id="1" ctype="x-sup">{}</bpt>1<ept id="1">{}</ept>The height of the wheelchair space location is the vertical distance from the tread of the row of seats directly in front of the wheelchair space location to the tread of the wheelchair space location.</source>
