<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="3947" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">The calculation is based on the front of the wheelchair space location being located 12 inches (305 mm) from the back of the seating tread directly in front and the eye of the standing spectator being set back 8 inches (205 mm) from the riser<ph id="1">&lt;/rpr id=&quot;117&quot; transform=&quot;close&quot;&gt;</ph><bpt id="2" rid="1">&lt;rpr id=&quot;65&quot;&gt;</bpt>.<ept id="3" rid="1">&lt;/rpr id=&quot;65&quot; transform=&quot;close&quot;&gt;</ept></source>
