<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="3966" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">Horizontal dispersion shall not be required in assembly areas with 300 or fewer seats if the wheelchair space locations are located within the 2nd and 3rd quartile of the row length.</source>
<target xml:space="preserve"></target>
