<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="3966" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">If the row length in the 2nd and 3rd quartile of the row is insufficient to accommodate the required number of companion seats and wheelchair spaces, the additional companion seats and wheelchair spaces shall be permitted to extend into in the 1st and 4th quartile of the row.</source>
<target xml:space="preserve"></target>
