<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="3972" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">Assembly areas with 300 seats or less other than those utilized for viewing motion picture projections shall not be required to comply with Section 802.10.2 where all wheelchair space locations are within the front 50 percent of the total rows.</source>
