<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="3980" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">Where tiered seating is provided, wheelchair space locations shall be integrated into the tiered seating area on a riser or a cross-aisle.</source>
<target xml:space="preserve"></target>
