<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="3984" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">Located within the area of an auditorium in which the vertical viewing angles, as measured to the top of the screen, are from the 40th to the 100th percentile of vertical viewing angles for all seats as ranked from the seats in the first row (1st percentile) to seats in the back row (100th percentile).</source>
<target xml:space="preserve"></target>
