<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="4016" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">In pass-through kitchens where counters, appliances or cabinets are on two opposing sides, or where counters, appliances or cabinets are opposite a parallel wall, clearance between all opposing base cabinets, countertops, appliances, or walls within kitchen work areas shall be 40 inches (1015 mm) minimum.</source>
