<trans-unit id="5629" mq:status="NotStarted" mq:segmentguid="0cf8ec4e-2390-47a3-aa62-8803960c8614" mq:lastchangedtimestamp="2026-07-21T07:30:06Z" mq:lastchanginguser="EmmaG" mq:maxlengthchars="-1" mq:nosplitjoin="false" mq:firstlabel="4371" mq:lastlabel="4371" mq:autosplitjoinstate="0" mq:lastmodifrole="0" mq:multipleexactmatch="false">
<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="4371" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">2.<ph id="1">&lt;mq:ch val=&quot;	&quot; /&gt;</ph>Where an accessible route makes a 180-degree turn around an object that is less than 48 inches (1220 mm) in width, clear widths shall be 42 inches (1065 mm) minimum approaching the turn, 48 inches (1220 mm) minimum during the turn and 42 (1065 mm) inches minimum leaving the turn.</source>
<target xml:space="preserve"></target>
<context-group>
<context context-type="x-mmq-structural-context">trans-units / trans-unit#9361 / struct-rpr#1</context>
