<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="4373" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">4.<ph id="1">&lt;mq:ch val=&quot;	&quot; /&gt;</ph>Where an accessible route makes a 90-degree turn the clear widths approaching the turn and leaving the turn shall be 36 inches (915 mm) minimum.</source>
