<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="4374" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">5.<ph id="1">&lt;mq:ch val=&quot;	&quot; /&gt;</ph>An accessible route with a clear width less than 60 inches (1525 mm) shall provide passing spaces at intervals of 200 feet (61 m) maximum.</source>
