<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="4433" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">3.<ph id="1">&lt;mq:ch val=&quot;	&quot; /&gt;</ph>At water closets where wall space will not permit a grab bar complying with Section 604.5.2, reinforcement for a rear wall grab bar 24 inches (610 mm) minimum in length centered on the water closet shall be provided.</source>
