<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="4439" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">Reinforcement shall accommodate a swing–up grab bar centered 153/4 inches (400 mm) from the centerline of the water closet and 28 inches (710 mm) minimum in length, measured from the wall to the end of the horizontal portion of the grab bar.</source>
