<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="4477" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">A lavatory complying with Section 1104.11.3.1.1 shall be permitted at one end of the bathtub if a clearance 48 inches (1220 mm) minimum in length and 30 inches (760 mm) minimum in width is provided in front of the bathtub.</source>
