<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="4601" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">Where a system permitting voice communication between a visitor and the occupant of the unit is provided at a location other than the unit entry door, the system shall comply with Section 1106.6.</source>
