<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="4607" mq:hasfollowingobject="hasfollowingobject">Where a closed-circuit communication system is provided, the public or common-use system interface shall comply with Section 1106.6.1, and the unit system interface in units required to have communication features shall comply with Section 1106.6.2.</source>
<target xml:space="preserve"></target>
